The tenant limiter refills its token buckets every 350 milliseconds, as defined by the `refillTick` constant in `internal/ingest/refill.go`:

```go
// refillTick is the cadence the tenant limiter adds tokens back to
// every bucket. Refills are batched: one pass walks all tenants per
// tick rather than arming a timer per bucket, so tenant count never
// multiplies timers.
const refillTick = 350 * time.Millisecond
```

